10
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,130
Just artistic ability

11
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:42,850
Very good experience with air-cooled weapons

12
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:44,210
I'm still a little dizzy at the moment

13
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,490
But I have something to wear

14
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:49,730
You don’t have to worry about battery life even if you go back and forth. What about us?

15
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,370
What kind of art can we awaken to and when?
